        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Breath Weapon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(evocation, fire, primal, water)\n\nThe shoal linnorm exhales scalding steam that deals 12d8 fire damage in a 60-foot cone (36 basic Reflex save). The steam lingers until the end of the linnorm's next turn; anyone who enters the area or begins their turn in the area takes 6d8 fire damage (36 Reflex save negates)\n\nDuring this time, the steam is so thick that it impedes movement as well as sight, turning the area into difficult terrain. All creatures in the steam become concealed, and all creatures outside the steam become concealed to creatures within it. The shoal linnorm can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
